Your Gopher hole is ~/public_gopher, at gopher://runv.club/1/~you

The menu is ~/public_gopher/gophermap. A line without tabs is plain
text. A link is a type, a label and a selector separated by tabs, for
example a text file and a menu:

  0My notes<TAB>/~you/notes.txt
  1Old stuff<TAB>/~you/old

Files must be readable by others (chmod 644). Scripts and executable
gophermaps are turned off here.
